      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهنّأ</span></b>  <i>He gave many gifts.</i> (IAar.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهنّأ</span>
